  }}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Brand Review"} badge={"Label-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Nature's Bounty Protein Powder Review</Fragment>
      What Nature's Bounty actually sells as protein powder today, what is on the label, whether it is tested, and the better-value powders to buy if your store no longer stocks it.
    </ArticleHeader>

