          <p>
            Nature's Bounty protein powder costs about $2.50 to $3.14 per 25 g of protein at the prices we found in November 2026, which is expensive for the protein you get. ShopRite listed the 16 oz chocolate at $19.49, a delivery-app listing put the vanilla from $21.69, and CVS listed the 16 oz canister at $24.49.
          </p>

          <p>
            The math: 13 servings of 15 g is 195 g of protein, or 7.8 portions of 25 g. Divide the price by 7.8 and you get about $2.50 at $19.49, about $2.78 at $21.69 and about $3.14 at $24.49. By comparison, mainstream whey usually costs $1 to $1.50 per 25 g, and the NSF-certified plant powder in our cards comes in around $1.84.
          </p>

