            Prices vary by store, and a drugstore buy-one-get-one promotion, when one runs, can cut the effective cost almost in half. At half price, the shake drops to about $1.25 to $1.57 per 25 g, which is competitive, so this is a product to buy on promotion if you buy it at all.
