          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Nature's Bounty protein powder is a 15 g soy-and-whey vitamin shake with collagen, fiber and probiotics, sold in one 16 oz size and two flavors. It has no published third-party certification, costs about $2.50 to $3.14 per 25 g of protein at the prices we found, and is getting harder to buy as the brand's own site drops it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
